# Rust
target/
# Cargo.lock IS committed. D-016 left this open and the repo contradicted
# itself: this line ignored it while bumi/bun.lock, puma/uv.lock and two others
# were tracked. A workspace that ships a binary commits its lockfile, and
# reproducible CI wants all of them. See DECISIONS.md D-031.
**/*.rs.bk

