# Generated
*.generated.*

# buf-generated proto code is COMMITTED, not ignored.
#
# It was ignored from e36dd29 ("keeps PRs reviewable") until 2026-08-17. That
# reason is handled by .gitattributes linguist-generated=true, which collapses
# these diffs already — while ignoring them meant `just gen` produced no diff by
# construction, so nothing could detect codegen drift, and rumi-proto went its
# whole life uncompiled without CI noticing.

# Scratch (working notes, not committed)
scratch/

